message: "If you use these data or analysis scripts, please cite the archived Zenodo release."
title: "Persian-Language Human Annotation Pilot on Policy Stance, Group-Directed Hostility, and Arousal: Data and Analysis Code"
type: dataset
version: "1.0.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24331046"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Pegi1727/Persian-hostility-pilot"
authors:
  - family-names: "<Family name as listed on Zenodo>"
    given-names: "<Given name as listed on Zenodo>"
abstract: >-
  Data and analysis code for a Persian-language human annotation pilot on
  policy stance, group-directed hostility, and arousal. Three annotators
  each rated 32 stimuli across four scenarios, yielding 96 annotation
  records. The results are exploratory and do not validate the separate
  320-stimulus candidate dataset or evaluate automated model performance.
keywords:
  - Persian language
  - human annotation
  - policy stance
  - group-directed hostility
  - arousal
  - inter-annotator agreement
  - pilot study
